                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1f00bee9-ad32-3a8a-99e5-57fe5b1d0bd6",
                        "entry_id": "d4d4aeea-3af1-37f5-8c27-1883b8f0487a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "неявный, скрытый, отличный от прямого значения высказывания смысл, который восстанавливается с учётом ситуации, контекста"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "924c59a5-2850-479c-a615-9db1f713b471",
                                "sense_id": "1f00bee9-ad32-3a8a-99e5-57fe5b1d0bd6",
                                "text": "Не только самостоятельное сознательное использование выразительных средств речи, но и понимание их своеобразной и насыщенной семантики, определяющей эмоциональный подтекст речи (иногда не менее существенный, чем её текст, выраженный логическим построением слов), является продуктом усвоения культуры. 〈…〉 Выразительные движения ― это выразительный «подтекст» … к некоторому тексту, который необходимо знать, чтобы правильно раскрыть смысл подтекста."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "55ecd14a-0c47-4685-937f-6dfb1b9ec523",
                                "sense_id": "1f00bee9-ad32-3a8a-99e5-57fe5b1d0bd6",
                                "text": "Драматизм этой симфонии звучит, как подтекст к основной теме."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "94692d4f-a4bb-4685-b41f-2f1dbbdb02ae",
                        "source_entry_id": "d4d4aeea-3af1-37f5-8c27-1883b8f0487a",
                        "source_sense_id": "1f00bee9-ad32-3a8a-99e5-57fe5b1d0bd6",
                        "target_lang_word": "implication",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "implication",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f40aa216-a141-3232-abfe-499fa216e512",
                                        "entry_id": "d94154e3-fb85-3448-8b36-d0b2a4d3b98d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of implicating."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "39ae6e1f-2f75-393c-836e-8ac640579c0a",
                                        "entry_id": "d94154e3-fb85-3448-8b36-d0b2a4d3b98d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being implicated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "345de53a-84f7-3d43-a34b-f0ef7e5c3827",
                                        "entry_id": "d94154e3-fb85-3448-8b36-d0b2a4d3b98d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A possible effect or result of a decision or action."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29adc30c-d8eb-41a0-99b2-5e72477d9650",
                                                "sense_id": "345de53a-84f7-3d43-a34b-f0ef7e5c3827",
                                                "text": "Dumping waste in the river will have serious implications for the environment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9cda800-5360-4823-ab1f-59c1731c43cb",
                                                "sense_id": "345de53a-84f7-3d43-a34b-f0ef7e5c3827",
                                                "text": "And while that number is expected to shift back slightly into positive territory over this decade, fewer children today establishes an unmistakable implication for tomorrow: fewer adults available as consumers, workers and taxpayers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f283a632-aef1-4f39-8159-d2feca712760",
                                                "sense_id": "345de53a-84f7-3d43-a34b-f0ef7e5c3827",
                                                "text": "With his legal maneuverings, Trump is showing that he also understands the implications of this election — one that could give him substantial powers as president to defray or dismiss many of the legal threats that he’s facing and to behave in office without future accountability."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e291a48-5341-3103-96c3-7f24936e0a4d",
                                        "entry_id": "d94154e3-fb85-3448-8b36-d0b2a4d3b98d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An implying, or that which is implied, but not expressed; an inference, or something which may fairly be understood, though not expressed in words."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "584ee984-de21-4130-ba09-84c71a3f2b64",
                                                "sense_id": "6e291a48-5341-3103-96c3-7f24936e0a4d",
                                                "text": "But we can also take a more analytical attitude to these displays, interpreting the movements as no more than approachings, touchings, and departings with no implication that one shape caused the other to move."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "831797b3-415b-31ca-a8f7-3006d3a4218a",
                                        "entry_id": "d94154e3-fb85-3448-8b36-d0b2a4d3b98d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The connective in propositional calculus that, when joining two predicates A and B in that order, has the meaning \\\"if A is true, then B is true\\\"."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "880a7c24-1ca9-3c51-9dea-3f6fb88002ba",
                                        "entry_id": "d94154e3-fb85-3448-8b36-d0b2a4d3b98d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Logical consequence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "94184de8-8643-4fe5-a7b6-254cef5d92da",
                        "source_entry_id": "d4d4aeea-3af1-37f5-8c27-1883b8f0487a",
                        "source_sense_id": "1f00bee9-ad32-3a8a-99e5-57fe5b1d0bd6",
